--- !u!114 &1709852092
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1709852081}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 40fe67fde4a4351409089804b4848b92, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _documentationText: 'Human Segmentation PPHumanSeg Example

    Segments people
    on each input frame with PPHumanSeg and optionally composites or hides the foreground.

    

    Demonstrates:

    -
    Reading input frames via MultiSourceToMatHelper (webcam, video file, image file,
    or GPU readback)

    - Loading PPHumanSeg ONNX/Sentis model from StreamingAssets

    -
    Toggling Sentis vs OpenCV DNN inference and optional async segmentation

    -
    OpenCV path uses Dnn.ENGINE_CLASSIC; ENGINE_AUTO (new OpenCV 5 engine) yields
    incorrect PPHumanSeg masks

    - Converting RGBA frames to BGR, applying segmentation
    mask Mat, and compositing background

    

    OpenCV classes and APIs used:

    -
    Mat, Size, Scalar

    - Imgproc: cvtColor, resize, threshold

    - MultiBackendNet,
    MatSingleFlightSyncAsyncRunner, MultiBackendDnn

    - MultiSourceToMatHelper,
    OpenCVMatUnityUtils

    

    Referring to:

    https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo/tree/master/models/human_segmentation_pphumanseg

    

    [Tested
    Models]

    https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo/raw/2027dd2f5a8a5746b5d4964900a0465afc6d3a53/models/human_segmentation_pphumanseg/human_segmentation_pphumanseg_2023mar.onnx'
  AlignmentSetting: 0
